      "created_at": "2018-09-30T14:43:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I have a question about Captain Cosmic:Requital’s incapacitated side.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It says before getting rid of your cards shuffle all constructs into a deck and place your character card on top of that deck. Then on his turn he can play a construct or the top card under his character card in a different field. Can I do this to the villain deck? If I can does that mean the villain can’t play cards? Or is this mechanic just suppose to be used on Captain Cosmic’s deck? Or possibly on another player’s incapacitated deck?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:59.609Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
