      "raw": "<p>So I have a question about Captain Cosmic:Requital’s incapacitated side.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It says before getting rid of your cards shuffle all constructs into a deck and place your character card on top of that deck. Then on his turn he can play a construct or the top card under his character card in a different field. Can I do this to the villain deck? If I can does that mean the villain can’t play cards? Or is this mechanic just suppose to be used on Captain Cosmic’s deck? Or possibly on another player’s incapacitated deck?</p>",
