      "id": 222636,
      "name": "pwatson1974",
      "username": "pwatson1974",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-30T15:03:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No.</p>\n<p>When you are incapacitted you put all the constructs in CC's deck under his card.</p>\n<p>The first&nbsp; incap ability sys you can move 1 construct or the top card under this card to a new play area. So you may move a construct already in play to a new area or put a new construct in play from the top of the construct deck you made when he was incapacitated. You can't mesddle with other decks.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:37.381Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
