      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>No.</p>\r\n<p>When you are incapacitted you put all the constructs in CC's deck under his card.</p>\r\n<p>The first&nbsp; incap ability sys you can move 1 construct or the top card under this card to a new play area. So you may move a construct already in play to a new area or put a new construct in play from the top of the construct deck you made when he was incapacitated. You can't mesddle with other decks.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
